msgid "and  are equally mechanical and equally deserve tables — they wait on a WHO/FHIR adapter, because a table keyed to facts no tool emits looks authoritative and is not."
msgstr "y  son igualmente mecánicas y merecen igualmente tablas —aguardan un adaptador WHO/FHIR, porque una tabla vinculada a hechos que ninguna herramienta emite parece autorizada y no lo es."

